    "Agt_RedDot_Preset": {
        "desc": "通用红点预设。flt_hsv_rescue.entry_* 是严格HSV救援的入口开关,取值 off/shadow/active/inherit(跟随mode)。三个入口共用同一套处理与出口,只决定'父块从哪来':entry_aspect=长宽比闸拒绝的块(v3原有入口);entry_confidence=过闸打过分但分不够的块(多是连片把封闭区搅成杂散空洞,竖长与偏白一起塌);entry_confidence_rej=前者无解时回头搜同帧被长宽比拒的块(证据仅1条,固定shadow只记录不改判)。mode 是硬总开关,off 时三个入口一律不跑。预算(max_full_runs/time_budget_ms)全局共享,不随入口数增长。改这里之前先跑 agent/recognition/replay_rdd_samples.py 全语料回放,判据是 result_parity 100% 且救回的每一条经肉眼确认是真红点。",
        "recognition": "Custom",
        "custom_recognition": "RedDotDetector",
        "custom_recognition_param": {
            "flt_red_hsv": [
                {
                    "lower": [
                        0,
                        140,
                        120
                    ],
                    "upper": [
                        12,
                        255,
                        255
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "lower": [
                        165,
                        140,
                        120
                    ],
                    "upper": [
                        180,
                        255,
                        255
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "flt_area": [
                30,
                1200
            ],
            "sc_min_conf": 0.55,
            "sc_gap_ratio": 0.35,
            "flt_hsv_rescue": {
                "mode": "active",
                "entry_aspect": "inherit",
                "entry_confidence": "inherit",
                "entry_confidence_rej": "shadow",
                "max_delta_s": 110,
                "max_delta_v": 110,
                "max_full_runs": 12,
                "min_stable_states": 2,
                "max_parents": 5,
                "time_budget_ms": 40
            }
        }
    },
